{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-gen-14-1","title":"Genesis 14:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The battle of four kings against the king of Sodom and his allies. 12 Lot is taken prisoner. 14 Abram rescues him. 17 Melchizedek blesses Abram at his return, who gives him tithes. 21 The rest of the spoil, his partners having had their portions he restores to the king of Sodom.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2091. B.C. 1913. Shinar. 10:10; 11:2; Isa 11:11; Da 1:2; Zec 5:11 Ellasar. Isa 37:12 Elam. 10:22; Isa 21:2; 22:6; Jer 25:25; 49:34-39; Eze 32:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-2","title":"Genesis 14:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Sodom. 10:19; 13:10; 19:24; Isa 1:9,10 Admah. De 29:23; Ho 11:8 Zeboiim. 1Sa 13:18; Ne 11:34 Zoar. 19:20-30; De 34:3; Isa 15:5; Jer 48:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-3","title":"Genesis 14:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>salt sea. 19:24; Nu 34:12; De 3:17; Jos 3:16; Ps 107:34; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-4","title":"Genesis 14:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>they served. 9:25,26 they rebelled. Eze 17:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-5","title":"Genesis 14:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Rephaims. 15:20; De 3:11,20,22; 2Sa 5:18,22; 23:13; 1Ch 11:15; 14:9; Isa 17:5 Ashteroth.The same as Ashteroth, a city of Bashan, where Og afterwards reigned.</p>\n<p>De 1:4; Jos 12:4; 13:12,31 Zuzims. De 2:20-23; 1Ch 4:40; Ps 78:51; 105:23,27; 106:22 Emims. De 2:10,11 Shaveh Kiriathaim. or, the plains of Kiriathaim;Kiriathaim was beyond Jordan, 10 miles west-ward from Medeba, and afterwards belonged to Sihon, king of Heshbon.</p>\n<p>Jos 13:19; Jer 48:1,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-6","title":"Genesis 14:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Horites. 36:8,20-30; De 2:12,22; 1Ch 1:38-42 El-paran. or, the plain of Paran. 16:7; 21:21; Nu 12:16; 13:3; Hab 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-7","title":"Genesis 14:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Kadesh.En-mishpat or Kadesh, was about 8 leagues south of Hebron.</p>\n<p>16:14; 20:1; Nu 20:1; De 1:19,46 Amalekites. 36:12,16; Ex 17:8-16; Nu 14:43,45; 24:20; 1Sa 15:1-35; 27:1-12 1Sa 30:1-31 Hazezon-tamar.Called by the Chaldee, \"En-gaddi,\" a town on the western shore of the Dead Sea.</p>\n<p>Jos 15:62; 2Ch 20:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-8","title":"Genesis 14:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>same. 2; 13:10; 19:20,22 in. 3,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-10","title":"Genesis 14:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>slime pits.Places where asphaltus or bitumen sprung out of the ground: this substance which is properly denoted by the word \"slime,\" abounds in these parts.</p>\n<p>11:3 fell. Jos 8:24; Ps 83:10; Isa 24:18; Jer 48:44 the mountain. 19:17,30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-11","title":"Genesis 14:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>16,21; 12:5; De 28:31,35,51</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-12","title":"Genesis 14:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Lot. 11:27; 12:5 who. 13:12,13; Nu 16:26; Job 9:23; Jer 2:17-19; 1Ti 6:9-11; Re 3:19; 18:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-13","title":"Genesis 14:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>one. 1Sa 4:12; Job 1:15 the. 39:14; 40:15; 41:12; 43:32; Ex 2:6,11; Jon 1:9; 2Co 11:22; Php 2:5 dwelt. 13:18 Mamre. 24; 13:18 Amorite. 10:16; Nu 21:21 and these. 24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-14","title":"Genesis 14:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>his brother. 11:27-31; 13:8; Pr 17:17; 24:11,12; Ga 6:1,2; 1Jo 2:18 armed. or, led forth. Ps 45:3-5; 68:12; Isa 41:2,3 trained. or, instructed. born. 12:5,16; 15:3; 17:12,27; 18:19; 23:6; Ec 2:7 Dan. De 34:1; Jud 18:29; 20:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-15","title":"Genesis 14:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>And he. Ps 112:5 smote. Isa 41:2,3 Damascus. De 15:2; 1Ki 15:18; Ac 9:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-16","title":"Genesis 14:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>11,12; 12:2; 1Sa 30:8,18,19; Isa 41:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-17","title":"Genesis 14:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>to. Jud 11:34; 1Sa 18:6; Pr 14:20; 19:4 after. Heb 7:1 king's. 2Sa 18:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-18","title":"Genesis 14:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>king. Ps 76:2; Heb 7:1,2 bread. Mt 26:26-29; Ga 6:10 the priest. Ps 110:4; Heb 5:6,10; 6:20; 7:1,3,10-22 the most. Ru 3:10; 2Sa 2:5; Ps 7:17; 50:14; 57:2; Mic 6:6; Ac 7:48; 16:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-19","title":"Genesis 14:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>he blessed. 27:4,25-29; 47:7,10; 48:9-16; 49:28; Nu 6:23-27; Mr 10:16; Heb 7:6,7 Blessed be. Ru 3:10; 2Sa 2:5; Eph 1:3,6 high. Mic 6:6; Ac 16:17 possessor. 22; Ps 24:1; 50:10; 115:16; Mt 11:25; Lu 10:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-20","title":"Genesis 14:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>blessed. 9:26; 24:27; Ps 68:19; 72:17-19; 144:1; Eph 1:3; 1Pe 1:3,4 which. Jos 10:42; Ps 44:3 tithes. 28:22; Le 27:30-32; Nu 28:26; De 12:17; 14:23,28; 2Ch 31:5,6,12 Ne 10:37; 13:12; Am 4:4; Mal 3:8,10; Lu 18:12; Ro 15:16; Heb 7:4-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-21","title":"Genesis 14:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>persons. Heb. souls. 21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-22","title":"Genesis 14:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>lift. Ex 6:8; De 32:40; Da 12:7; Re 10:5,6 unto. 21:23-31; Jud 11:35 the most. 20; 17:1; Ps 24:1; 83:18; Isa 57:15; Da 4:34; Hag 2:8 possessor. 19; 21:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-23","title":"Genesis 14:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>That I. 1Ki 13:8; 2Ki 5:16,20; Es 9:15,16; 2Co 11:9-11; 12:14 lest. 2Co 11:12; Heb 13:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-14-24","title":"Genesis 14:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Save. Pr 3:27; Mt 7:12; Ro 13:7,8 Aner. 13 let. 1Co 9:14,15; 1Ti 5:18</p>"}]}